libdbf
------------------------------------------
This is a C library to read DBF files. The code is originally from
https://sourceforge.net/projects/dbf.berlios/. While the dbf code from that
source compiles just fine, the underlying library doesn't.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libdbf-devel-0.0.2-1bl3
  libdbf0-0.0.2-1bl3
  libintl8-0.26-1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.26-1
  intltool-0.51.0-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libintl-devel-0.26-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/quentindemetz/libdbf

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/quentindemetz/libdbf/archive/refs/tags/0.0.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libdbf-0.0.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libdbf-0.0.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libdbf-0.0.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdbf-0.0.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdbf0-0.0.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdbf-devel-0.0.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libdbf)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libdbf.README
  /usr/share/doc/libdbf/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libdbf/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libdbf/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libdbf/README
  /usr/share/locale/de/LC_MESSAGES/libdbf.mo

(libdbf0)
  /usr/bin/cygdbf-0.dll

(libdbf-devel)
  /usr/include/libdbf/libdbf.h
  /usr/lib/libdbf.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libdbf.pc

